migrationMessage:
Convert {count} entries from the old editor to the new format.

· Text, headings, lists, quotes, code, images, audio and video are kept;
· Text colour, highlighting and alignment cannot be expressed in the new format and will be dropped;
· Migration only changes the storage format on this device — it is not synced as an edit, so migrate each device separately;
· The original is backed up first and can be restored at any time.
